<TextPage
  heading="Refunds, cancellations and disputes"
  title="Refunds and cancellations"
  description="How refunds, cancellations and disputes work for Supernova's digital guide, sessions and monthly support. All amounts in USD."
  lastUpdated="26 November 2026"
>
  <p>All prices and refunds are in US dollars (USD).</p>

  <h2>Digital products</h2>
  <p>The Seven Generations Protocol is a digital product delivered immediately, and is sold as a final sale. That said: if you are deeply dissatisfied with the quality of what you received, write to us at support@supernova.is and we will consider a refund. We would rather hear from you than have you keep something you believe was not worth the money.</p>

  <h2>Sessions and facilitation programmes</h2>
  <p>A session can be cancelled or rescheduled at no cost with at least 24 hours' notice. A session that has not been held can be refunded in full. For the five-session programme, sessions not yet held are refunded pro rata at the per-session rate.</p>

  <h2>Monthly support</h2>
  <p>You can cancel at any time. Your access continues through the end of the period you have already paid for. We do not pro-rate part-months.</p>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>Write to support@supernova.is from the address you used for the purchase, with the date and the amount. We reply within five working days. Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method; your bank may take a further 5–10 working days to show it.</p>

  <h2>Disputes</h2>
  <p>If something has gone wrong with a payment, write to us before opening a dispute with your bank — we can almost always resolve it faster ourselves.</p>

  <h2>EU consumers, digital content</h2>
  <p>By completing the purchase of a digital product and accepting immediate delivery, you consent to the download beginning at once and acknowledge that the statutory right of withdrawal for digital content no longer applies once delivery has begun.</p>
</TextPage>
